phase_d_dispositions.realization:
When fine dust has been cleared by rain,
the skilled person presses the key point of direct perception,
and takes the inner lamps as the path.; Own identity: awareness as vajra chains,
separating going and coming, in space. [N-167](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-167); Distinguish through the ninth wind;
distinguish entry into abiding through methods.; This, too, is the key point of completion in the Ground. [N-167](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-167); Self-appearance is complete as pure from the outset;
knowing, holding, and conceptual thought are all exhausted. [N-167](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-167)

The entry of words is like this:
Brahmā, the All-Pervader, and the Hundred-Giver;
the Sky-Soarer, the Powerful Lord, and the Fierce One;
their respective sounds and the voices of gods.; For the Fierce One, entry is in three and two. [N-170](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-170); The activity of arranging signs: seven and four. [N-170](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-170); From the root foundation of other places— [N-170](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-170)
through conceptual thought about words: one hundred and two places. [N-170](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-170); Extending from that: four hundred and four. [N-170](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-170); The calculation of definite particulars becomes ten. [N-170](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-170)

Primordial knowing encompassed by knowing
pervades all buddhas and karmic beings
indivisibly, without intrinsic nature.; In the appearance aspect of karmic beings of the six classes,
it abides in each one's continuum:
in gods, it is complete in its own clarity;
in asuras, subtle and flashing;
in humans, round and clear of itself;
in animals, clear within;
in hungry ghosts, subtle;
in hell, complete as self-appearance. [N-178](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-178); Primordial knowing encompassed by objects of knowledge
is to be known in two aspects.; Of these, I shall explain objects of knowledge in their multiplicity.; ‘Whatever’ refers to the natural state;
‘multiplicity’ completes everything without remainder.; ‘Primordial’ concerns the benefit of all karmic beings;
through ‘knowing,’ the three realms are drawn out from their depths. [N-178](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-178); I shall explain the primordial knowing that knows how [things are].; Through knowing the natural state of entities,
and realizing one's own benefit, the flow of delusion is exhausted.; ‘How’ refers to the natural state;
‘view’ engages without distraction. [N-178](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-178)

Wind, according to the sequence of a day,
is reckoned as twenty thousand, one thousand,
and six hundred;
the winds of one day are thereby complete.; According to the particular distinctions,
for the young there are sixty extra;
for the old there is a shortfall.; Among sixty movements of wind,
the subtle movement of the nature of phenomena is held through reckoning.; From two such groups it is coarse;
when these are gathered as three, it is gross.; Subtract three from that: it is even. [N-188](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-188); The nature of phenomena of time is as follows:
outer, inner, secret,
and suchness—four.; The outer is the second [month] of autumn,
showing the abiding of the nature of phenomena of time.; Suchness is held through wind.

Having thus arrived, the measures of completeness are:
cessation of what appears directly before one;
introducing appearance into earth and stone;
one's own knowing entering anything;
through that entry, moving matter;
taking the measure of wind's movement; [N-193](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-193)
seeing the body's minute particles arises;
whatever appears is complete as form embodiment;
there, father and mother embrace;
fivefold fathers and mothers join;
all are within a round encircling band.; The yogin's body too is clear light;
going, coming, and abiding—
all are awareness reaching its measure. [N-194](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-194)

Having thus arrived, the measures of completeness are:
cessation of what appears directly before one;
introducing appearance into earth and stone;
one's own knowing entering anything;
through that entry, moving matter;
taking the measure of wind's movement; [N-193](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-193)
seeing the body's minute particles arises;
whatever appears is complete as form embodiment;
there, father and mother embrace;
fivefold fathers and mothers join;
all are within a round encircling band.; The manner of reaching the measure also becomes like this:
free from the particles of each body,
windows of light appear in the open sky.; The body's material weight self-ceases:
a stainless body of light with unimpeded penetration.; At its center is the sign of A,
and rays from the brow curl measure one armspan.; The topknot appears held back by wind. [N-194](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-194); There is activity of ordinary mind without sound.; At this time one's body is brought to its measure:
the three embodiments, with unimpeded penetration, gathered into one. [N-194](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-194)

Distinguished, there are four aspects;
here I shall explain the intermediate state of the nature of phenomena.; A body of light endowed with all faculties
becomes like a shadow from the body. [N-198](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-198); Knowing how to spread and hold them,
one completes the buddhas' qualities
and does not enter the three realms. [N-198](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-198); Five connected spheres are single embodiments;
from half-embodiments, forms become complete.; From embodiments with half-forms, there are fivefold pairs.; As each cluster becomes complete,
there are groups of five, ten, and a hundred;
clusters of a thousand and a hundred thousand
appear pure in the intrinsic nature of what is envisaged. [N-198](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-198); Innumerable, beyond what expression can encompass—
when one oneself knows their intrinsic nature,
one attains the three embodiments gathered into one.

Furthermore, I shall explain the nature of phenomena of the continuum.; The lamp-light of self-aware primordial knowing blazes.; The view, free from fear, completes the lion's expressiveness;
with self-awareness ripened, completeness arises naturally;
vajra chains connect, a garland of pearls;
appearances of experience form an array of jeweled inlay;
self-abiding emptiness is the mirror of the core;
deviations are cut of themselves: the mirror of awakened mind.; One in basic space, there are also six expanses.; With qualities complete, precious things are heaped.; Because awareness ripens, embodiment-relics blaze.; Thus, because the nature of phenomena is inexpressible,
it arises as the foundation of conventional phrases.

The natural state established in its own disposition
also has seven manners of abiding:
spontaneous presence from the side of diversity;
indeterminacy from the aspect of the extent of change;
certainty through not changing;
appearance's expressiveness transforming into anything;
all arising, together with affirmation;
primordial purity because delusion is purified;
and the variegation held to be diverse manners of appearance. [N-206](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-206); Through such distinctions in what is asserted,
because the Great Perfection appears as anything,
although differing assertions are numerous,
in the view of abiding in its own disposition
there is no one, no two, and freedom from anything.

Even taking life and taking what is not given
arise from me and are my phenomena. [N-207](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-207); Viewing phrases has seven stages;
their respective assertions are constructed by the conceptual mind:
freedom from doing and absence of striving;
gradual entry and drawing out distinctions of self and other;
taking life, and freedom from virtue and wrongdoing;
nothing done and nothing arisen;
unaltered appearance, self-purified;
and afflictions held to be liberated in intrinsic nature. [N-207](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-207); Meaning is viewed in direct perception of the nature of phenomena,
not through discerning knowing,
but as the very domain of the faculties.; In the identity of seeing the three key points,
because the three phrases are explained as key points,
there are no sharp or dull faculties.; Because seeing the nature of phenomena purifies,
there is no good or bad in activities.; The nature of phenomena is empty and without divisions;
virtue and wrongdoing, both, are removed. [N-207](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-207); Without seeing self-awareness directly,
the assertions of the nine stages do not liberate.; When the nature of phenomena is exhausted and its limit reached,
the three embodiments are the appearance of the path.

Cultivation that abides without deviation:
the faculties' gates are clear,
and the mental faculty's conceptual thought does not move.; The mental faculty that examines knowing itself
does not escape outward.; It is not a clarity marked by divisions;
it has not gone into an emptiness cut off separately;
it is not a continuous succession of bliss;
it has not become a stagnant pool of equanimity. [N-211](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-211); Resting in clear mindfulness and awareness;
training's contrary aspects having become the path;
an apprehending aspect with a continuous inward ease;
an apprehending aspect clear in its manner of parts;
and casting out colors and syllables—
when one has not fallen to the side of any of these,
this is cultivation abiding without deviation. [N-211](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-211)

The characteristics and manner of appearance of cultivation:
its characteristic is empty, clear awareness;
its intrinsic nature is mixed with nothing;
the limits of apprehended object and apprehending subject are exhausted;
and the nature of phenomena is pure in its own identity.; In the intrinsic nature of pure causes and conditions,
entities and absence of entities are self-purified;
clinging to the objects of the five gates is purified;
the order of the elements is purified;
and the increasing appearance of pure primordial knowing is shown.; There is the nature of phenomena of exhaustion. [N-212](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-212); The faults of not cultivating are:
the characteristics of cyclic existence manifest;
self and other, objects and knowing,
a view bound to phrases,
and objects bound to an object of focus—
afflictions bind [one] as a self.; The path of buddhahood is also lost;
the intrinsic nature of the result is not known;
there is no Ground of the evenness of all phenomena;
self-awareness is bound in the three realms;
and one falls into what is accompanied by conceptual thought. [N-212](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-212)

Cyclic existence being purified, there is passing beyond sorrow.; Furthermore, the view of pure seeing:
the great completeness of self-purified absence of entities.; There is no need to make offerings to deities;
there is no mantra recitation or austerity;
no incense, lamps, or food offerings to deities;
no gathering offerings or offerings to the lama;
no praise or burnt offerings;
no scope of activity of the six perfections.; Thus, with no Ground or root whatsoever:
taking life, taking what is not given, and unchaste activity— [N-213](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-213)
there is no view, no cultivation, and no activity.; With nothing to view or enact, what assertion of cultivation is there?; Ordinary mind's assertions of emptiness and clarity cease.; Likewise, phenomena and the phenomena of buddhahood are absent. [N-213](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-213)

Emptying the Ground of cyclic existence in the three realms,
one sweeps away transcendence of sorrow.; Cutting the root of ignorance and cyclic existence,
one uproots the result of the three embodiments.; Giving an edge its sharp temper, not even one [thing] is cut.; With great breadth and an empty center, not even one [thing] fits.; Gathering diversity, one is not found.; Striking all, not even one is cut;
striking one, all are to be killed.; A hundred people in iron fetters—not one is freed;
holding one, all are freed.; Through freedom, the path of liberation above is exhausted.; The cause of entering activity ceases. [N-218](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-218)

Since there is no arising, there is no self;
neither taking nor casting away is the seal of embodiment.; Arouse desire, but do not become attached.; Having become attached, let go.; Do not disparage another's body or set [your own] above it.; Do not interrupt the flow of mantra and seals.; Furthermore, I shall explain sacred pledges and vows.; Lamas and buddhas are supports for offerings;
to Dharma, the community, chosen deities,
and vajra ḍākinīs,
do not cut the flow of gathering offerings and other offerings.; On seeing a lama endowed with the characteristics,
make praise and offerings complete.; Do not disparage women; do not become angry.; Do not disparage the aggregates; rely on the chosen deity.; Relying on mandalas, mantras, deities,
and seals is authentic.; Do not break up gatherings of the faithful;
do not disturb the ordinary minds of those possessing virtue.; Possessing vows, abide in the sacred pledges. [N-219](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-219)

Constantly, through ointments and pills,
introduce the channels into a net of spheres. [N-220](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-220); Garlands, necklaces, and half-[necklaces] too,
beautiful and encircling, are to be connected.; The doing of activity is clear and without entities.; Take the foremost of supreme spiritual accomplishments;
make the wheel of adornments at the six places. [N-220](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-220); Furthermore, reliance and entry:
relying on the lama ceases the flow of cyclic existence;
relying on empowerment ripens body and voice;
relying on sacred pledges brings spiritual accomplishments;
through reliance on the view, the three realms are cut off;
through reliance on cultivation, the flow of delusion stops;
relying on activity trains the body.; Whatever arises from these objects of reliance
is itself sacred pledges and vows.; Activities of entry have eight aspects;
bodily entry is fivefold;
voice has eight aspects;
ordinary mind's entry is thirty-twofold.; The special functioning of body and ordinary mind
is the distinction between karma and primordial knowing. [N-220](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-220); Furthermore, the abiding-wheel of cultivation:
through training the body with diverse bodily exercises,
ordinary mind comes to abide.; Through three applications, soothe the channels;
draw ordinary mind in gently.; Through applications of signs and skillful craft—
through the distinct methods for body and ordinary mind,
make the yogin's ordinary mind abide. [N-220](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-220)

Gather the light of sun and moon; draw in the ocean.; Weigh the Mount Merus of a three-thousandfold world on a balance.; Reverse the Ground of ignorance: self-awareness. [N-221](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-221); Draw cyclic existence out entirely; block the path of transcendence of sorrow.; The result is self-complete, the Ground of the nature of phenomena;
doing and acting self-cease.; Delusion concerning phenomena makes an upper basis (yas gzhi). [N-221](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-221); The three realms made the path, there is no buddha.; For whom could the teacher's teaching exist? It does not.; All phenomena are without a Ground; for whom could a root exist?; Ordinary mind free from existence and without desire,
uncontrived in intrinsic nature, is beyond expression.; Deluded conceptual thought of doing and acting is exhausted.; There are no phenomena, no buddhas, and no karmic beings.; There is no I, no self, no apprehended object and no apprehending subject. [N-221](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-221)

Distinguished through colors:
white, clear, and gentle accomplishes pacifying;
yellow, subtle, and long accomplishes increasing;
red, limpid, and proliferating is the activity of power;
blue-green, black, and short accomplishes the fierce.; When it is variegated, broken, and whirling,
distinctions of various activities are accomplished.; When it is extremely subtle, there is falling.; When broken and fierce, obstacles arise.; When spreading tongues of fire have smoke,
sacred pledges deteriorate. [N-232](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-232); Distinctions through sound:
three successive lhab lhab sounds and many spar spar sounds
accomplish diverse [activities].; Fierceness and crackling [accomplish] the fierce;
roaring and dense [sound accomplish] pacifying and increasing, the two;
resounding and ringing accomplish the supreme. [N-232](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-232); The definitive signs of colors:
through the four beginning with white,
pacifying and the rest are definitely accomplished.; When brown-black, rough, and whirling,
the yogin does not accomplish the aim.; When white and clear, rising and billowing,
the supreme spiritual accomplishment is definitely attained.; Through sounds that resound and ring,
whoosh, roar, and are dense,
food, clothing, and the result are accomplished.; Through sir, sil, and lhab sounds,
the bliss of each of the three embodiments is attained. [N-232](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-232); Know white, red, and the other colors from the preceding account.; Indeterminate change does not accomplish the aim.; Clarity and shining accomplish the supreme.; Its sounds are shag and sdig— [N-232](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-232)
through tog and sing, various activities [are accomplished];
through roaring and sing, the supreme is attained.; White, red, and the other colors are as above.; Blackness and turbulence do not accomplish the aim.; Variegated blazing accomplishes the supreme.; Its sounds are roaring, muffled, and diverse;
ringing and diverse [sounds] bring supreme attainment. [N-232](../translations/2026-10-01-golden-aligned/LEGACY-NOTES.md#n-232)
